---
// SCR-20, asking to close the account. Destructive, so it sits on its own page (DEV-06 §4-4) and
// the island asks twice — `terminated` is terminal, and reopening means a fresh application
// (DEV-09 §2-2-2).
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { requireActiveOrganizationForPage, requireMemberSession } from "../../lib/server/auth/page";
import WithdrawalForm from "../../lib/components/withdrawal-form.svelte";

const session = await requireMemberSession(Astro);
if (session instanceof Response) return session;

const organization = requireActiveOrganizationForPage(Astro, session);
if (organization instanceof Response) return organization;
---

<Layout title="退会・取引終了のお申し出 — マイページ">
  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8">
    <p class="eyebrow">マイページ</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl text-balance">退会・取引終了のお申し出</h1>

    <div class="mt-8 max-w-prose leading-loose text-pretty text-ink-soft">
      <p>お申し出の後、運営で内容を確認のうえ手続きを行います。手続きが完了するまでは、これまでどおりご利用いただけます。</p>
      <ul class="mt-6 flex list-disc flex-col gap-2 pl-5">
        {
          /* Said before the button, not after the refusal: the operator's side rejects termination
            outright while these exist, and finding that out afterwards is a wasted round trip. */
        }
        <li>進行中のご発注、または未入金のご発注が残っている場合は、それらの完了後の手続きとなります。</li>
        <li>お取引が終了すると、御社のすべてのご担当者がログインできなくなります。</li>
        <li>再びお取引をご希望の場合は、あらためて新規のお申し込みが必要です。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <WithdrawalForm client:load organizationName={organization.name} />

    <p class="mt-16 text-sm">
      <a href="/mypage" class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-vermilion">マイページへ戻る</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
